	(text "NOTES:\n1. For 2K 2716 EPROM / 2816 EEPROM\nCut trace from SJ1-1 to SJ2-2\nSolder from SJ1-2 to SJ2-3\nInsert part so pin 12 is at IC3-14 (GND)\n2. (E)PROMs that may be used:\n2K: 2716, 2816\n4K: 2732\n8K: 2764, 27C64, 28C64"
